  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rapid response to cover the immediate basic needs of 2,500 households (17,500 people) in a situation of food insecurity in the Far North and South West Regions of Cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">this project aims at covering the basic needs of the most vulnerable populations (affected by War Ukraine + floods) in the Far North (Mayo Danay, Mayo Tsanaga and Chari - Logone) and South West (Meme) while initiating immediate emergency food production through 30-day cash assistance combined with the distribution of productive support to facilitate a rapid and sustainable recovery while building resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
